</li>
<li id="user-content-fn-6">
<p>As with all these in-buffer settings, pressing  activates any changes in the line. <a href="#user-content-fnref-6" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 6" class="data-footnote-backref">↩</a></p>
</li>
<li id="user-content-fn-7">
