</li>
<li id="user-content-fn-8">
<p>It will still be listed on that date after it has been marked
as done.  If you do not like this, set the variable
<code>org-agenda-skip-scheduled-if-done</code>. <a href="#user-content-fnref-8" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 8" class="data-footnote-backref">↩</a></p>
</li>
<li id="user-content-fn-9">
<p>Using capture templates, you get finer control over capture
locations.  See <a href="#capture-templates">Capture templates</a>. <a href="#user-content-fnref-9" data-footnote-backref="" aria-label="Back to reference 9" class="data-footnote-backref">↩</a></p>
</li>
<li id="user-content-fn-10">
